Package: susieSlide
Type: Package
Title: Slider Single-Effect Regression for Genetic Fine-Mapping
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("William", "Denault", role = c("aut", "cre"),
    email = "maintainer@example.org")
Description: Extends the individual-level Sum of Single Effects regression
    engine with a bounded, component-specific heterozygote slider. Gaussian
    effect coefficients are integrated analytically and slider parameters
    are estimated by empirical Bayes. Includes compiled sufficient-statistic
    calculations, genotype-count safeguards, and slider-aware predictions
    and credible-set purity. Uses the extension hooks in susieR 0.16.6.
License: BSD_3_clause + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports: susieR (>= 0.16.6), Matrix, stats
Suggests: testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
NeedsCompilation: yes
